Check out the paper Andrew linked:

http://www.stat.columbia.edu/~gelman/research/unpublished/waic_understand_final.pdf

This is basically the material on WAIC for the forthcoming
3rd edition of Bayesian Data Analysis.  See section 2.5 for
a discussion of issues with hierarchical models.  The short
answer is that it depends what you consider data!

- Bob

