It works for me, but I'm the only one that ever tests with 4.5.x (although my x = 4). Can you tell us everything about what Linux distribution you are using? Also, can you edit the makefile to add -v to the end of the line that starts with CFLAGS, so that it looks like:

CFLAGS = -I src -I $(EIGEN) -I $(BOOST) -Wall -DBOOST_RESULT_OF_USE_TR1 -DBOOST_NO_DECLTYPE -DBOOST_DISABLE_ASSERTS -v

Then try to make bin/libstan.a again and attach the output so we can see in more detail what went wrong.

Thanks,
Ben

